1 NAME Nils /Person Rokne/
2 GIVN Nils
2 _MARNM Person Rokne
2 NICK Vossa Niels
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1 JAN 1784
1 BAPM
2 DATE 9 AUG 1784
2 PLAC Lille Rokne
