2 CONT This census shows him as Lars Eirikson and it is incorrectly indexed as Sarse Enickson. This census only lists names for males. It shows 1 male under 5 (don't know who this child is), 1 male aged 5-9 (likely Torkel), 1 male aged 3
2 CONC 0-39 (likely Lars), 1 female aged 5 - 9 (probably Nellie although she was b in 1829 so it would make her at least 10), 1 female aged 10 - 14 (Randvei), 1 female aged 30 - 39 (Herborg), 1 person employed in agriculture (Lars), 4 fr
2 CONC ee white under 20, 2 free white 20 - 49, Total free white 6, Total all free 6. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1850 US Census https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/8054/4193364-00262/19205816?backurl=https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/102017666/person/300013448821/facts/citation/900065016859/edit/record
2 CONT
2 CONT 1855 Illinois State Census https://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?db=1079&h=1320526&indiv=try
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars Erickson appears on this census which just names the male head of family. It records 1 male aged 10-20 (likely Charles Benjamin), 1 male aged 20-30 (likely Torkel), 1 male aged 50-60 (likely Lars). 1 female aged 10-20, (possi
2 CONC lby Nellie but she is 4 years out on age being born 1931), and 1 female aged 50-60 (likely Herborg). It indicates that one son is available for Military duty. He has livestock valued at $931.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1860 US Census https://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?indiv=1&dbid=7667&h=37913036&ssrc=pt&tid=102017666&pid=300013448821&usePUB=true
2 CONT
2 CONT This census has him indexed as Rass and Sarse and is recorded as being 63 years of age.The writing is odd. He is living with his wife and son Charles. They have a servant Julia Williamson aged 25, b. in Norway; and a labourer Thom
2 CONC as Christopherson, aged 30;, b. in Norway; enumerated with them. Lars is farming and his real estate is valued at $4480 and personal property at $800.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1870 US Census https://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?db=7163&h=17316750&indiv=try
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars and Herborg (Harriet) are residing with their son Charles and his family in 1870. Lars is writted as Morris and he is 74 years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1872 Death Notice, Ottawa Free Trader (Newspapers.com) https://www.newspapers.com/image/215016209/?terms=lars%2Berickson
2 CONT
2 CONT 1872 Find-A-Grave https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=134086879 NOTE: Second wife is incorrect information. He was only married once. Daughter does not belong to him. There is extensive information on him in His
2 CONC tory of Emigration from Voss and in the Vossingen's). He was married in Norway and came with his family. He died in 1872 and his wife in 1876. They came to America in 1837) I can find no record of this child mentioned in the Voss 
2 CONC church books. It can't have been in America as he was not there in 1822.
2 CONT
