1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Ragnhild Nilsdatter Bergo''' was born in 1814 in Evanger, Voss, Hordaland, Norway. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-73241515 Nils Johannesson Bergo] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-52203739 Brita Gulleiksdatter 
2 CONC Fadness]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnhild married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626574354 Olav Knutson Mestad] in 1836 in Evanger, Voss, Hordaland, Norway. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34631363735 Knut Olson Mestad]; [
2 CONC https://www.geni.com/profile-34713954158 Nils Olson Mestad]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34713954199 Johannes Olson Mestad]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34713954630 Ole Olson Mestad]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626246461 
2 CONC Guri Olsdotter Rongen (Mestad)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34714092997 Knut Olson Mestad]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34714093019 Lars Olson Mestad]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34714092908 Brita Olsdotter Almelid]; [http
2 CONC s://www.geni.com/profile-34714158033 Gulleik Olson Mestad]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1889 in Evanger, Voss, Hordaland, Norway. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
