1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Endre var gift 2 ganger og hadde to barn med første konen og to eller tre barn med andre konen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: Vossaboki. 4 : Gardssoga, 3 : Kvitlar, Bordals og Vikjar åttungar
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The following detail is found on page 358, Tesdal, in Kindem’s Vossaboki IV.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Tesdal, page 358
2 CONT
2 CONT Endre, Øystein’s father, was married two times and had two children with his first wife and two or three with the other:  Øystein, Mikkjel f. 1635, g. m. the widow Torbjørg Knutsdr. and lived at Skjeldal, Olav Flatekvål who had th
2 CONC e son Jørgen Bø, Tjukkeb, Eli, g. 1. m Knut, 2. m. Nils Himle.  Endre probably had a son Torstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''For overview of Tesdal line, consult Kindem’s Vossaboki IV, Tesdal, (pages 357, 358, 359) and for Himle, in Vossaboki IV, (pages 249-254) and Øvre Himle (pages 259-260).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Himle, page 249
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1648 there were four tenant farmers:  Knut Nilsson, g. m. Eli Endresdatter Tesdal, Lars  Eirikson, g. m. Torbjørg, Halle Jørgenson, g. m. Brita, and Jon Andersson, g. m. Marta….Knut and Eli had the children:  Nils, Kåre, Lars a
2 CONC nd Dønåt.  Nils died before 1725 and had four children:  Knut Vivås, Odd Himle, Gudve, g. m. Svein Hovda and Dønåt, g. m. Sone Himle.  Kåre got married with Marta Arnesdatter who died in 1721, and Kåre died before 1725.  They had 
2 CONC four children:  Knut En, Lars f. 1667, Synneva, g. m. Olav, and Eli, g. m. Sjur En.  Synneva and Olav had three children:  Guro f. 1690, Mål f. 1692 and Marta f. 1696.  Dønåt was g. m. Jon Andersson Himle.  When Knut died, Eli was
2 CONC  married again with Nils and had the daughter Synneva.  She was married and had three children:  Mål, g. m. Arne Sevestad in Nordhordland, Marta and Eli.
2 CONT
2 CONT 250
2 CONT
2 CONT Jon Andersson Himle sold in 1652 with approval of his wife, Dønat Knutsdatter, on behalf of her and her brother’s three children, 2 pund at Himle to Eli Endresdatter.  She was Jon’s mother-in-law.  The three brothers’s children we
2 CONC re named Nils, Kåre and Lars Knutson, all discussed above.
2 CONT
2 CONT 254
2 CONT
2 CONT Odd Nilsson f. 1671 …. bought 12 mark at Øvre Himle from Gudve Nilsdatter Hovda.
2 CONT
2 CONT Øvre Himle, page 259
2 CONT
2 CONT The farmers at Øvre Himle in 1661 and 1664 were Øystein Endreson and the sexton. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 260
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Nilsson was g. 1717 m. Kristi Larsdatter Øvre Vinjo.  He was the tenant farmer in 1723 on the sexton’s farm….Anders died in 1740…and had three children:  Anna f. in 1719, g. 1743 M. ekm. Lars Litlere, Brita f. in 1725, g. 1
2 CONC 750 m. Nils Jonson Mølster and Ingebjørg f. in 1727.  Kristi was remarried in 1741 m. Jon Larsson Hemre and died in 1744.  Jon was the tenant farmer after Anders. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tesdal, page 358
2 CONT
2 CONT Tesdal was listed in the tax census in 1657….In the matrikel for 1661, Tesdal was recorded as Finne property…. Øystein Endreson owned 1 pund in 1691 and Lars Miltzow 2 pund in 1695.  Endre, Øystein’s father, was married two times 
2 CONC and had two children with his first wife and two or three with the other:  Øystein, Mikkjel f. 1635, g. m. the widow Torbjørg Knutsdr. and lived at Skjeldal, Olav Flatekvål who had the son Jørgen Bø, Tjukkeb., Eli, g. 1. m. Knut, 
2 CONC 2. m. Nils Himle.  Endre probably had a son Torsetin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Øystein was, in 1661 and 1664, the farmer at Himle and, in 1691 and 1695, the tenant farmer at Tesdal.  He was g. m. Inga Hallesdr. (Hallvardsdr.?).  Both died before 1725 and they had six children:  Endre, Gudve, g. m. Bjarne And
2 CONC ersson Dagestad  f. 1659, Marta, in the Widow’s Home at Vangen, Brita f. 1662 g. m. Bjarne Monsson Bokkatun, Ragna f. 1666, g. 1. m. Eirik Oddson
2 CONT
2 CONT 359
2 CONT
2 CONT Storå Saude f. 1669, 2. m. Hermann Hermannson Rjodo, Anna, g. 1. m. Sjur Asserson Storå Saude f. 1666, 2. m. Per Oddson Skjelde, 3. m. Oddmund Skjelde.
2 CONT
2 CONT Endre Øysteinson was g. 1. m. Rannveig Knutsdr., 2. m. Anna Olavsdr. and 3. 1725 m. Kari Styrksdr. Fære.  Endre was recorded as primogeniture farmer in the census of 1701 and owned 2 pund.  He died in 1736, 63 ½ years gl. and had 
2 CONC five children with Rannveig, four with Anna and three with Kari:
2 CONT
2 CONT …. Olav f. 1727, Anna f. 1729, g. 1748 m. Anders Larsson Haug and Synneva f. 1732, g. 1758 m. Torgis Sverkveson Litlere.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
