1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''For overview of Tesdal line, consult Kindem’s Vossaboki IV, Tesdal, (pages 357, 358, 359).'''''''''''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT 359 Tesdal.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Endre Øysteinson''' was g. 1. m. Rannveig Knutsdr., 2. m. Anna Olavsdr. and '''3. 1725 m. Kari Styrksdr. Fære.''' '''Endre''' was recorded as primogeniture farmer in the census of 1701 and owned 2 pund. He '''died in 1736, 63 y
2 CONC ears gl. and had five children with Rannveig, four with Anna and three with Kari.
2 CONT '''
2 CONT (The three with Kari) '''Olav''' f. 1727, '''Anna''' f. 1729, g. 1748 m. Anders Larsson Haug and '''Synneva''' f. 1732, g. 1758 Torgis Sverkveson Litlere.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note above that '''Olav''' f. 1727 d. 1792 '''was one of the children of Endre and Kari'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT ………….
2 CONT
2 CONT The individual bruks.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bruk I. Tesdal. Kari, the widow after Endre, was remarried in 1737 m. Eiliv Olavson Vele who died in 1739, 31 years gl. without descendants. Olav Endreson f. 1727, g. 1753 m. Brita Larsdr. Haug bought 1 pund from his mother in 
2 CONC 1750. Olav died in 1792, Brita in 1814, 87 years gl. and had three children: Endre f. 1755, Eirik f. 1758, g. m. Rannveig Johannesdr. Rue and Kari f. 1764, g. 1798 m. Velom Eirikson Berge.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Should read, Velom Eilivson Berge.)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
