2 CONC om his mother in 1750. '''Olav died in 1792, Brita in 1814, 87 years gl. and had three children:'''  Endre f. 1755, Eirik f. 1758, g. m. Rannveig Johannesdr. Rue and '''Kari f. 1764, g. 1798 m. Velom Eirikson Berge.'''<br/>
