2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=103322635
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Jan. 25, 1856 Menard County Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Jan. 13, 1931 Pope County Minnesota, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Excerpt from The Starbuck Times Jan. 22, 1931 pg. 1;
2 CONT
2 CONT He moved with his parents, Claus & Annie Knutson to Gilchrist township, Pope Co., MN. shortly afterwards, coming at the time the Indians were rebellious and pioneer life was dangerous as well as difficult.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Dorthia and 4 sons and 4 daughters were born to them. The children are Mrs. H. Lee, Brooten, MN., Nils and Andrew Clausen of Sunburg, Mrs. John Sharpness, Kerkhoven, Mrs. Olan Hanson, Brooten, Alfred Clausen, also Broot
2 CONC en, Rosie Landsperk, Sunburg & Claus Knutson of Starbuck,who died following an automobile accident a year ago last summer. Mrs. Clausen & the other children survive, as well as 21 grandchildren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:
2 CONT *Dorthea Clausen (1857 - 1941)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT *Nels Clausen (1884 - 1954)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Rolling Forks Lutheran Cemetery  Pope County Minnesota, USA Plot: Section SW-
2 CONT
