1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==From Minnie Holtan's Memories==
2 CONT Martha married a neighbor’s son, Pete Tverberg. Their children were: Gurina, Ella, Oscar, Lena, and Nora. Martha died when her twins were born. The twins died and all are buried at West St. Olaf. Later Lena and Nora died and are a
2 CONC lso buried at West St. Olaf. Gurina lived to be old and married I. [J.?] Newgard. She died and is buried in Grafton, North Dakota. Ella married G.[?] Tully, lived to be old, and was buried in Kasson. Oscar married, lived to be old
2 CONC , and died and [is] buried in Minneapolis. 
