2 CONT
2 CONT Knud or Knut & Klaussen or Klausen
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: December 11, 1930 (91) Fjærvoll, Bø i Vesterålen, Nordland, Fjærvoll is a remote location where my grandfather was born & where my great-grandfather, Peter Lockert Johnsen, lived until 1945. Anyone have any idea why Knut wa
2 CONC s there in his later years? My wife & several cousins hiked up to this spot in the summer of 2011 & we could only find traces of the foundation. It sits high on a hill & is very exposed to the weather. It is also quite far from th
2 CONC e ocean. An odd place for a fisherman to live. Almost of his relations lived right on the ocean so he must have stored his boat with them.
2 CONT
2 CONT see http://www.dahlenett.org/tng/getperson.php?personID=I27659&tree=Tree1
