1 NOTE
2 CONT John emigrated in 1877, but is not listed in the 1885 census for Walsh county, ND.  His first child, Martha, was born in February of 1888 in North Dakota.
2 CONT
2 CONT He very well may be the Hans Rudstad, age 22, laborer, listed on page 430 of the 1880 census for Codington County, T 118 R 53 or Dakota territory.  Codington county is the Watertown, SD county.
2 CONT
2 CONT The following couple is from the 1885 Federal Census for Dakota and is most likely not our John Anderson Raustad.  John should have been about 27, and his first known wife had a first name of Marion, and John was a carpenter.
2 CONT  06-067-44  Anderson, John   25 Druggist   Norway      Grafton   Walsh 
2 CONT  06-067-45  Anderson, Elise   22                  Norway      Grafton Walsh
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Arthur Markve sheet, he broke his legs in a mill. On  the 1900 census, he rented his home.
