2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Voss, Norway, the son of Knud R. Glimme and Britha J. Himle. Peter was one of 9 children, of which most emigrated to the U.S. He married Madli Spilde in 1887 in Lodi, Wisconsin. They had no children. Lived first in Oakland
2 CONC , Ca, then Chicago, Wisconsin and back to Chicago, where other family was living at the time. Had a brother Amund Glimme in Leeds Township, Wisconsin.
