1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Ben Berge DEERFIELD - Ben Berge, 85, died today at this farm home in the town of Christiana after a week's illness.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by two sons, John, Madison, and Harry, town of Christiana; nine grandchildren, and one great-grandchild.
2 CONT
2 CONT The body is at the Schultz funeral home, Deerfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT January 18, 1949 Wisconsin State Journal:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ben Berge, Cambridge, Leaves $17,000 Estate Ben J. Berge, 86, Cambridge, who died Dec. 31, left an estate of $17,000, county court records revealed today.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Berge bequeathed nine-twentieths of his estate to one of his sons, A. John Berge, 4213 Manitou way, secretary of the University of Wisconsin alumni assn.; one-twentieth of the estate of another son, Harry, Cambridge, and the o
2 CONC ther half of the estate to Mrs. Charles Berge, Cambridge, his widowed daughter-in-law, and her four children.
