1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Berge Services DEERFIELD - Funeral services for Nick Berge, 83, lifelong resident of Deerfield who died Wednesday in a Stoughton hospital, will be held at 2 p.m. Monday in the Deerfield Lutheran church. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Rev. E. J. Tetlie will officiate. Burial will be in the Deerfield Lutheran cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Berge is survived by a daughter, Evelyn, at home; two sons, Norris, Madison, and Russell, Deerfield; four grandchildren, and one great-grandchild.
2 CONT
2 CONT Friends may call at the Schulz funeral home.
