1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Peter was born to Raghild and Styrk Erickson on 12-21-1846 in Palmyra, Jefferson county, Wisconsin.
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Peter married Thone Tina Tinnes in 1873 in Palmyra, Wisconsin.</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>The 1880 census listed Peter and Tina living in Palmyra, Renville county, Minnesota. Living with them was Peter's mother, Julia, age 61, born in Norway. Peter and Tina had four children:
2 CONT <p>Rosetta - b June 1874</p>
2 CONT <p>Minnie - age 4</p>
2 CONT <p>Effie - b Sept. 1877</p>
2 CONT <p>Charlotte - b June 1879</p>
2 CONT <p>Peter's occupation was listed as a farmer.</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>The 1900 census has Peter, age 55, and Tina, age 46, living in Beaver Falls Township, Renville, Minnesota. Living with them are Effie, age 23 - servant, Charlotte, age 21 - clerk, George, age 19 - at school, and Florence, age 1
2 CONC 5 - at school.
2 CONT <p>Peter's occupation was listed as Register of Deeds.</p>
2 CONT <p></p>
2 CONT <p>Peter died sometime after 1916.</p>
