1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kari was born in April 1786 at the farm Styve in Evanger, Voss kommune. She was the oldest of three children. The family moved to Manger in Radøy kommune where they lived in 1801. She was married to Jon Sjursen Dyr
2 CONC kollbotn in 1813. They lived at Dyrkollbotn and got seven children there during the period 1815-1832. Kari died 25th of October 1832, only three months after her last child was born.
