1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Guri Olsdotter Rongen (Mestad)''' was born in 1844 in Evanger, Voss, Hordaland, Norway. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626574354 Olav Knutson Mestad] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626318222 Ragnhild Nils
2 CONC datter Bergo]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Guri married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626246421 Brynjulf Brynjulvson Rongen] in 1874 in Evanger, Voss, Hordaland, Norway. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626270526 Brynjulv Brynjulv
2 CONC son Rongen]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-21612765293 Olav Brynjulvson Rongen]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626271909 Johannes Brynjulvson Rongen]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626271956 Synneva Brynjulvsdotter Skutle (Ron
2 CONC gen)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626271990 Nils Brynjulvson Rongen]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 17, 1939 in Evanger, Voss, Hordaland, Norway and was buried on January 24, 1933 in Evanger kirkegård. 
2 CONT ----
