1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gjertine Knutsdatter Fadness Henderson Buried in an unmarked grave. Born in Leeds Township, Wisconsin, to Knut G. Fadness and Inger B. Skjerveggen. Married Claus Lohne- Henderson. ( Once immigrated to U.S the famil
2 CONC y changed their surname from Lohne to Henderson) They had the following children: Henry, Emma, Betsy, Ingeborg, Ingeborg C.,Amanda, Knut, Rose, Carl B., Carl J.,Martin, and Louis. Claus was rumored to have been previously married 
2 CONC to a Bertha Alreck and had a child Margretha b 1860- but this information is not yet proven. Claus died 3 October 1926 in Velva Township, ND, buried at an unknown location. Gjertine died in Colburn Township, Wisconsin, in Chippewa
2 CONC  County.
