2 CONC eel. Anna and Josef traveled to Chicago in 1890 to visit their children and relatives and stayed there for three years. Anna was born in 1819, died in 1903, and Josef died in 1909. Six daughters: Marta b. 1844, Ingjerd b. 1845, b.
2 CONC  1870 m. Lars Josefson Lid, Guri b. 1847, b. 1871 m. Lars Jonson Bjørku, Kirsti b. 1850 (America), Sigvor b. 1858, married Olav Brynjulvson Glymme (America) and Soffi b. 1862, married Lars N. Hefte (America). Ho Marta was born in 
2 CONC 1869 m. Lars Jonson Lid, born in 1841, and they got skates in 1878 from her father on the farm for 3,200 kronor. Lars died in 1887, and Marta left the farm to her sister Guri and her husband Lars Jonson Bjørku and traveled with he
2 CONC r children to America. 
