1 NOTE Brita emigrated to Mr. Horeb, WI to her cousin, Sjur Øyelsen Nesheim, who was married to Ingeborg Edmunds.  Here Brita met Ingeborg's brother, Ole Edmunds, and they were married in 1885. Brita's two brothers, Lars and Ola emigrate
2 CONC d in 1881 and settled near Lake Preston, SD.  They sent word to Ole and Brita to join them there, which they did in 1882.  The move was by covered wagon with their three small children.  When she died in 1912 at age 50, she left c
2 CONC hildren aged 3 to 17.
