1 NAME Guro (Davidsdatter) /Klove/
2 GIVN Guro (Davidsdatter)
2 SURN Klove
2 _MARNM Klove
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 JUN 1842
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hordaland
3 CTRY Norway
