1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kari was the second child born to Knut Hendrikson Fadness and Anna Bergesatter Brunborg. Her father was born in Norway and began using the Brunborg location surname when he moved to Brunborg farm after his marriage
2 CONC  to Anna. Once in America they sometimes were know as Hendrikson, Fadnes or Brunborg. Although the childeren often used Brunborg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kari was born on the brunborg farm near Evanger, Norway and was baptized as Kari Knutsdatter Brunborg, She immigrated to Christiana Township, Dane County, Wisconsin in 1846 with her parents and three brothers, Berge,Hendrik and Ne
2 CONC ls. They came by sailing vessel "Kong Sverre."
2 CONT
2 CONT Kari married lars at Koshkonong Lutheran Church on Jan. 29.1862. They used Larson as the surname, but later used Nyre as the surname.
2 CONT
2 CONT Two children born to Kari and Lars are buried in the same cemetary.
