1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gunvor was born in 1805.  In 1838 she married Andres Nilson Lie.  They emigrated in 1841.  Their children were Marta, Nils, Sever, and Andres. 1.Marta was married to Helge Lie, but died young leaving two small chil
2 CONC dren, Mary and Andrew.  Their father remarried and moved to Britt, Iowa.  2.Nils married Mari Reque and they had three children, Sever, Julia and Peter.  3.Sever moved to North Dakota and had a large family of whom there are only 
2 CONC two left, Andrew and Nels.  Sever was a veteran of the Civil War and was imprisoned in the infamous Andersonville.  4.Andres was married twice.  His first wife was his cousin Gunhild, a daughter Nils.  She left three children.
