1 NOTE Knut and Guri were first farm employees on Gjøstein in Teppen, Voss, where he was supposedly born.  They later moved to Mørkve in 1828 when he traded farms with Viking Kjelson Mørkve.  Knut and Guri lived at Mørkve until their dea
2 CONC th. Most of their children were born at Gjøstein.  All their children (except for Bård who is said to have children who emigrated to America) have known descendants in America.
